* dual_infeasible_3x3 - 3x3 SDP: max X_11 s.t. X_22 = 1, X_33 = 1, X blkdiag >= 0
* PRIMAL UNBOUNDED (== dual infeasible): X_22 and X_33 are pinned but X_11 is free
*   to grow along the PSD cone, so max X_11 is +infinity.
* Recession ray Xhat = E_11: <A_1,Xhat> = <A_2,Xhat> = 0 (A_1=E_22, A_2=E_33),
*   <C,Xhat> = 1 > 0, Xhat >= 0 (eigs 1,0,0).
